      "options": {
        "content": "## How to read this dashboard\n\n- **Services Up, by Service** — which specific services are being scraped and reporting healthy.\n- **Overall Fleet Health** — a single aggregate % up across the whole applications layer; use it as a headline number, not for diagnosis.\n- **Request Latency p95** — only populated for services that install the shared HTTP latency histogram (`http_request_duration_seconds`). Blank does not mean broken.\n- **Services Down** — the actionable panel: any non-zero row here is a specific service to go investigate, identified by its real `job` label (`default/applications-<name>`).\n\n*Dashboard refreshes every 30 seconds.*",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
